# Never commit the ROM itself, program images, the Ghidra database or decompiled code.
# The rendered asset dump re/out/assets/ (pictures, animations, maps, text, samples made by
# re/tools/dump_assets.sh) was committed by user decision 2026-10-12, but is NOT in git now:
# 4c5c8b4 (2026-11-05, "del out") removed it and the two !re/out/assets/ exceptions below are
# commented out (55160d3), so re/out/* ignores the whole dump. Generate it locally when needed;
# uncomment those two lines, re-run the dump tool and commit it to restore (see CLAUDE.md).
*.zip
re/rom/
re/out/*
#!re/out/assets/
# The Rust port's probe and harness outputs (same rule as re/out/)
dino-rs/re/out/*
re/ghidra/proj/
re/ghidra/*.elf
re/ghidra/decomp*
re/ghidra/log*.txt
*.npy
*.png
*.bin
#!re/out/assets/**
# Raw disassembly / decompiler dumps of the original program
re/specs/**/*_dis.txt
re/specs/enemy/c2.txt
re/specs/enemy/hit_2a606.txt

# Tooling
re/.venv
__pycache__/
dino-rs/target/
.DS_Store
re/specs/**/scratch*/
.claude/*.lock
re/mame/roms
# MAME runtime output
cfg/
nvram/
# A player's settings file (plan D5, M2-01: key = value lines, dino-rs/crates/dino-game/src/game/flow/config.rs)
dino.cfg
.worktrees/
